<p>Canadian Prime Minister Mark Carney&#x27;s Liberal Party won two of the three vacant ridings in Monday&#x27;s special elections, giving the government a majority in the House of Commons. That means Carney can pass legislation without needing opposition support on every vote.</p><img src='https://kagiproxy.com/img/gL9tpuOe-oALVOBZuLfp_LICx-o6gOje08xidx_0e01ZFYDQHc6x3qR6WiRKkX5ewm4SlLuOKqP55eFqwGAO46p0ma3Whu-cUzcyHDQ97K8UPeNQYChAdLtv34rXxM3-hKtWJq4qPFLfILpblWW6T_9s8NkLIXoIOpnJkIy_vMlusKQVlE22n88kHTEsu86cD9Ozj572GHZsYJaSVP8cWfCqDNcpk5pYvHUmH1VGTStMYgQ' alt='Prime Minister Mark Carney of Canada at the Liberal Party’s convention in Montreal on Saturday. His agenda is focused on reducing Canada’s dependence on the United States.' /><br /><h3>Highlights:</h3><ul><li>Three ridings: Voters cast ballots in three vacant parliamentary districts in Ontario and Quebec, and two of those races were in seats that have long leaned Liberal.</li><li>A year of minority limits: The New York Times said Carney had spent the past year constrained by leading a minority government before Monday&#x27;s by-elections brought that period to an end.</li><li>Recent maneuvering: The Financial Times reported that Carney had been luring MPs from rival parties in recent months as he worked to strengthen his position.</li></ul><h3>Perspectives:</h3><ul><li>Mark Carney: Carney said a majority would help his government respond more effectively to the trade war started by President Trump and pass legislation suited to an increasingly divided geopolitical world. (<a href='https://www.scmp.com/news/world/united-states-canada/article/3349976/canadas-carney-secures-majority-government-special-election-wins'>South China Morning Post</a>, <a href='https://www.theguardian.com/world/2026/apr/14/canada-special-election-results-pm-mark-carney-majority-government'>The Guardian</a>)</li><li>Liberal Party: The Liberals framed the win as a chance to advance energy and trade ambitions while reducing Canada&#x27;s dependence on the United States. (<a href='https://www.straitstimes.com/world/carney-clinches-majority-government-to-push-energy-and-trade-ambitions'>The Straits Times</a>, <a href='https://www.nytimes.com/2026/04/13/world/canada/mark-carney-liberals-majority.html'>The New York Times</a>)</li></ul><h3>Sources:</h3><ul><li><a href='https://www.scmp.com/news/world/united-states-canada/article/3349976/canadas-carney-secures-majority-government-special-election-wins'>Canada’s Carney secures majority government with special election wins</a> - scmp.com</li><li><a href='https://www.dw.com/en/canada-carney-secures-majority-after-special-election/a-76770243'>Canada: Carney secures majority after special election</a> - dw.com</li><li><a href='https://www.thehindu.com/news/international/canadian-pm-carney-secures-majority-government-in-special-election/article70860021.ece'>Canadian PM Mark Carney secures majority government in special election</a> - thehindu.com</li><li><a href='https://www.lemonde.fr/en/international/article/2026/04/14/canadian-pm-mark-carney-secures-a-majority-government-with-special-election-wins_6752391_4.html'>Canadian PM Carney secures a majority government with special election wins</a> - lemonde.fr</li><li><a href='https://www.theguardian.com/world/2026/apr/14/canada-special-election-results-pm-mark-carney-majority-government'>Mark Carney secures majority government in Canada after special election win</a> - theguardian.com</li><li><a href='https://www.ft.com/content/cc3961cc-89e7-4928-8daa-fa746c278867'>Carney’s Liberals secure majority in Canadian parliament</a> - ft.com</li><li><a href='https://abcnews.com/International/wireStory/canadian-pm-carney-verge-majority-government-special-election-131987987'>Canadian PM Carney is on the verge of a majority government in a special election</a> - abcnews.com</li><li><a href='https://www.straitstimes.com/world/carney-clinches-majority-government-to-push-energy-and-trade-ambitions'>Carney clinches majority govern